  by the untagged way 100. Inside it: the pub (1), the bar (2), the bakery (5)
  and the Hall (way 101). Outside: the cafe (3), the peak (4), and a former shop
  (7, shop=no). Main Street
  (way 200) runs west to east along 50.02 N, through the town and out of it.
  The Trail (relation 2000) holds Main Street, the pub as a stop and, as a
  sub-relation, Testtown itself. The pub is the newest edit in the town, the
  only object with a timestamp (otmlib.gol dates a GOL by it).
-->
